# Board target: Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W only

This project **does not use ESP32**. Hardware and firmware target is **Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W (RP2350)** only.

ESP32 firmware and wiring docs were removed (`ESP32DevKitV1-ArduinoIDE-Code.ino`, `hardware_connection.txt`).

## Do

- Edit / generate firmware only in `Pico2W.ino`
- Use Pico 2 W APIs (`LittleFS`, `rp2040.restart()`, `TwoWire` pin remapping, etc.)
- Wire docs: `hardware_connection_pico2w.txt`
- OTA / telemetry platform string: `pico2w`
- Sensor count: **9** MPUs (`SENSOR_COUNT = 9`) — 8 limbs on TCA9548A `0x70` CH0–7 + `center` on TCA9548A `0x71` CH0

## Do not

- Do **not** create ESP32 firmware or re-add ESP32 wiring docs
- Do **not** ask whether to also produce an ESP32 version
- Do **not** use ESP32-only APIs (`Preferences`/NVS, ESP-IDF headers) in new firmware code
